            <div class="about-hero">
                <h2>About This Project</h2>
                <div class="project-description">
                    <p>
                        <strong>FixYourCode</strong> is an AI-powered code analysis platform that helps developers improve their code quality and understanding. Built with Node.js and Express, it leverages Google's Gemini AI to provide intelligent code analysis.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Users can paste code in various programming languages and receive:
                    </p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Improved code with detailed comments explaining changes</li>
                        <li>Best practices and suggestions for improvement</li>
                        <li>Line-by-line explanations of how the code works</li>
                        <li>Curated learning resources with links to tutorials and documentation</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>
                        The application features automatic language detection, a tabbed interface for easy navigation, and syntax highlighting for better code readability.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

